<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Notes body"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="685800" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="5486400" cy="7315200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" rIns="0" tIns="0" bIns="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">The original typed memory, lattice/authority implementation and prompt files remain in src/ams/memory/, src/ams/core/ and prompts. The latest audit checked 54 tracked files against Git HEAD. Existing surrounding files changed: data/mpbench.py introduces split-qualified internal IDs to avoid attack/benign collisions while retaining raw IDs/content; eval/lifecycle.py adds observation callbacks and saved fields; scripts/run_mpbench.py adds shared-pool coverage checks and write/outcome journals; configuration YAMLs route model roles to OpenRouter; providers/openai_client.py and pricing.py add guarded native billing and accounting. MINJA compatibility scripts are earlier infrastructure work, separate from this dynamic MPBench evaluation. The research code is largely added rather than edits inside original memory rules. The release package is not yet complete; untracked files and ignored reports/tests must be packaged deliberately before sharing.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve"></a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">SOURCES</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- README.md §5</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- reports/RESEARCH_AUDIT_20261101_REPORT.md</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0">